@startuml
'[brief] State exposing entry, do and exit actions. Verifies that the three callbacks are wired through the generated lambdas.

'[code] private:
'[code] int entries = 0;
'[code] int exits = 0;

[*] -> Standby

Standby : entry / entries++
Standby : exit / exits++
Standby --> Running : start

Running --> Standby : stop

@enduml
